WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.501
-Guys, you probably
heard me talking about

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:04.934
the new Ford F-150 Lightning.

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.767
It is the all-new electric --
all-electric new Ford truck.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.000
I'm freaking out about it.
It is awesome.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.667
I have an F-150.
And I use it to haul pumpkins...

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.934
-Yup.
-...and listen to country music.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.701
But this truck --

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:19.567
This truck, they've taken
to the next level.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.868
It is getting
crazy-good reviews.

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:24.167
It has 10 kilowatts
of electricity.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.267
So you can power your house
for three days from the truck.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.300
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.934
It could power
a wedding reception

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.367
in Yosemite National Park.

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:34.100
They did it. I saw it.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.534
It can go from zero to 60
in 4.6 seconds.

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:39.234
-What?!
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:40.934
What?!

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:43.801
-It's got it. It's got outlets.
It's got everything.

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:45.400
It's -- Giant touchscreens.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.067
It's the coolest-looking thing
I've seen.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.767
It's got this flip-down
armrest thing.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:51.000
It's just --
The whole thing is insane.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.133
And it's roomy. I sat in it.

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:55.501
It's actually more roomier

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:56.901
than my first apartment
here in the city.

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:58.234
-That's true.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.434
-But on top of it all,
it has a trunk --

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:02.434
get ready for this --
in the front.

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:03.567
-What?

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:04.801
-'Cause the engine's gone,
dudes.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.267
-What?!

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:08.734
-The engine's somewhere in the
unders. In the undercarriage.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.434
Yeah, I don't know where it is.
The engine --

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:12.300
-It's not there.
-They have a front trunk.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.667
-What do they call it?

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:15.701
-They call it
a Mega Power Frunk.

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:18.601
-Oy!
-I love it.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:21.434
I cannot wait to get this thing.
F-150 Lightning.

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:23.367
But I'm not the only one
who loves the thing.

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:24.901
It's already, like, a giant hit.

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.634
There's a band out there,
they wrote a song about it.

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:29.234
They're a Swedish pop duo
called Frunke.

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:32.634
-Frunke? With a...
-They're called Frunke.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:36.234
And the song is called
"Junk in my Frunk."

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:39.367
It's all about the things
that you can do with your frunk.

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:41.767
Anyway, they just
released a video for it,

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.734
and we're about to debut it
for you right now.

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:45.334
Ladies and gentlemen,
here's the world premiere

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:48.400
of Frunke's new video,
"Junk in my Frunk"!

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:51.834
[ Zapping ]

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:53.400
♪ Front ♪

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.300
♪ Trunk ♪

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:56.601
♪ Frunk ♪

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:59.033
