00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:00.968
♪ When the trunk's in the front,
then the truck's got frunk ♪

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:02.934
♪ So I store my stuff
in the truck's big frunk ♪

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.801
♪ Plug a boombox in
to bump the crunk ♪

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.734
♪ Then I hit the road
with my junk in the frunk ♪

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:08.767
♪ Got a sunk in my frunk,
a "Hunk" in my frunk ♪

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:10.801
♪ Headlamp on to spelunk
