00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:12.501
♪ Bass amp up,
play funk in my frunk ♪

00:02:12.501 --> 00:02:14.567
♪ Check the score,
slam dunk in my frunk ♪

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.167
♪ Boogie boards
