00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.100
♪ With disco ball
to start a rave ♪

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.300
♪ With camping gear
when I've got to brave it ♪

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.934
♪ Rubber duckies
I like to bathe with ♪

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:23.934
♪ What you thunk in my frunk
that I sunk in my frunk? ♪

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.634
♪ I became a professor,
went adjunct in my frunk ♪

00:02:25.634 --> 00:02:27.734
♪ Then I shrunk in my frunk,
chipmunks in my frunk ♪

00:02:27.734 --> 00:02:29.634
-♪ Stole my style,
went punk in my frunk ♪

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:31.467
-♪ Got an easel
