00:02:33.434 --> 00:02:35.300
♪ Computer lab
'cause I'm a smarty ♪

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.167
♪ And a lot of watermelon
for my patio party ♪

00:02:37.167 --> 00:02:39.033
♪ When the trunk's in the front,
then the truck's got frunk ♪

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:40.968
♪ So I store my stuff
in the truck's big frunk ♪

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:42.834
♪ Plug a boombox in
to bump the crunk ♪

00:02:42.834 --> 00:02:45.067
♪ Then I hit the road
