00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.934
[ Zapping ]

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:48.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:51.467
-Ah. Oh, my God.
-I love that.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.000
Thank you to our friends at Ford
for helping us out with that.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.634
To learn more about the Ford
F-150 Lightning, go to ford.com.

00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.467
I cannot wait for this thing.

